### 1. GET alle attraktioner (Virker i browser + HTTP-fil)
GET http://localhost:8080/attractions

### 2. GET specifik attraktion (Virker i browser + HTTP-fil)
GET http://localhost:8080/attractions/Tivoli

### 3. POST tilføj attraktion (Virker KUN i HTTP-fil/Postman)
POST http://localhost:8080/attractions/add?name=Legoland&description=Forlystelsespark%20i%20Billund

### 4. POST opdater attraktion
POST http://localhost:8080/attractions/update?pick=1&name=Legoland&newname=Legoland%20Billund&newdescription=Opdateret%20beskrivelse

### 5. POST slet attraktion
POST http://localhost:8080/attractions/delete/Bakken